          ],
          "content": "表 E.2 总结了^运算符的结合方式。"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.107,
            0.144,
            0.941,
            0.205
          ],
          "content": "| 位值 | b1 = 0 | b1 = 1 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| b2 = 0 | 0 | 1 |\n| b2 = 1 | 1 | 0 |",
          "captions": [
            {
              "bbox": [
                0.143,
